@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

title Target Marketplace - Ideal Component Map

actor "Web Client" as Browser
actor "Mobile Client" as Mobile
component "API Gateway\n(Nginx / Edge)" as Gateway
component "Frontend Web\n(Next.js)" as Web
component "Frontend Mobile\n(React Native or Flutter)" as App

component "Auth Service\n(FastAPI)" as Auth
component "User Service\n(FastAPI)" as User
component "Product Service\n(FastAPI)" as Product
component "Order Service\n(FastAPI)" as Order
component "Payment Service\n(FastAPI)" as Payment
component "Cart Service\n(FastAPI)" as Cart
component "Recommendation Service\n(FastAPI)" as Reco
component "AI Assistant Service\n(FastAPI + LLM)" as AI
component "Notification Service\n(FastAPI)" as Notify

database "Auth DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as AuthDB
database "User DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as UserDB
database "Product DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as ProductDB
database "Order DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as OrderDB
database "Payment DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as PaymentDB
database "Cart DB\n(Redis)" as CartDB
database "Vector Store\n(pgvector or dedicated DB)" as VectorDB
database "Object Storage\n(S3 compatible)" as ObjectStore

queue "RabbitMQ\n(Event Bus)" as MQ
database "Redis\n(Cache + Session + Rate Limit)" as Redis

Browser --> Web : HTTPS
Mobile --> App : HTTPS
Web --> Gateway : REST/JSON
App --> Gateway : REST/JSON

Gateway --> Auth : /auth/*
Gateway --> User : /users/*
Gateway --> Product : /products/*
Gateway --> Order : /orders/*
Gateway --> Payment : /payments/*
Gateway --> Cart : /cart/*
Gateway --> AI : /ai/*
Gateway --> Reco : /recommendations/*

Auth --> AuthDB : CRUD users
User --> UserDB : CRUD profiles/addresses
Product --> ProductDB : CRUD catalog/reviews/images
Order --> OrderDB : CRUD orders
Payment --> PaymentDB : CRUD payments
Cart --> CartDB : cart sessions
Product --> ObjectStore : product media
Reco --> VectorDB : embeddings + similarity search
AI --> VectorDB : retrieval context

Auth --> Redis : token session + blacklist
Product --> Redis : hot catalog cache
Order --> Redis : idempotency / lock keys
Payment --> Redis : webhook dedupe
AI --> Redis : short-lived conversation context

Auth --> MQ : AUTH_USER_REGISTERED
Cart --> MQ : CART_CHECKED_OUT
Order --> MQ : ORDER_CREATED / ORDER_CANCELLED / ORDER_STATUS_UPDATED
Payment --> MQ : PAYMENT_CREATED / PAYMENT_CONFIRMED / PAYMENT_FAILED
Notify --> MQ : consume and fanout notifications
User --> MQ : consume AUTH_USER_REGISTERED
Reco --> MQ : consume order + catalog events
AI --> MQ : optional moderation/review events

note bottom
Layered architecture expected in every backend service:
- Presentation (routers)
- Application (services)
- Domain (models/schemas)
- Infrastructure (db/redis/mq)
end note
@enduml
